[[631,251,"There were issues with communication and record keeping which impacted on the quality and effectiveness of the searches undertaken","inadequate search coordination",""],[632,251,"The location of the first NPAS heat source was not recorded accurately","inaccurate location recording",""],[633,251,"The outcome of the search into the first NPAS heat source was not recorded accurately by the Officers involved or the call handler","incomplete search documentation",""],[634,251,"The details of the second NPAS heat source were not heeded","neglected heat source",""],[635,251,"There was no liaison between Hartlepool and Stockton officers during the search","lack of inter‑agency liaison",""],[636,251,"There were delays in requesting Polsa Mutual Aid from neighbouring police forces","delayed mutual aid request",""],[637,251,"There were delays in requesting the involvement of Mountain Rescue","delayed mountain rescue request",""],[638,251,"the officer who was guided by NPAS to the first heat source did not have a full set of operational PPE for a search at night time in a dense area","inadequate personal protective equipment",""],[9421,3595,"There appeared to be a degree of uncertainty as to whether Mr Collins was assessed upon his arrival at the A&E department at James Cook University Hospital","lack of assessment upon arrival",""],[9422,3595,"It was stated that Mr Collins should have had hourly nursing observations taken during his first admission to A&E on 9.10.12","absence of hourly nursing observations",""],[9423,3595,"Evidence was given that the nursing notes in A&E were not fully completed and were not kept up to date","incomplete nursing documentation",""],[9424,3595,"the hand sanitiser gel was collected from the A&E department.","hand sanitiser gel accessible near patient",""]]